    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify">Reflects the 1-for-3.5 reverse stock split that became effective on
September 2, 2025, the 1-for-4 reverse stock split that became effective on January 6, 2026, and the 1-for-6 reverse stock split that
became effective on March 10, 2026. On a combined basis, this reflects retrospectively a reverse stock split of 1-for-84.</td></tr>
