  </table></ix:nonNumeric>


<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Company recorded a loss on sale of discontinued operations of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DiscontinuedOperationTaxEffectOfIncomeLossFromDisposalOfDiscontinuedOperation" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-12204">39,676</ix:nonFraction>. The proceeds on sale, which was the fair value of the buyer shares
received on Closing, amounted to $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DiscontinuedOperationGainLossOnDisposalOfDiscontinuedOperationNetOfTax" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-12205">728,550</ix:nonFraction>, and the carrying amounts of the net assets and liabilities sold amounted to $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="elab:DiscontinuedOperationCarryingAmountsOfNetAssetsAndLiabilities" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-12206">768,226</ix:nonFraction>.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

