<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify">As of June 30, 2026 and December 31, 2025, the Company had $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c270" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OtherLiabilitiesCurrent" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-12695">861,254</ix:nonFraction>
and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c271" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OtherLiabilitiesCurrent" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-12696">642,925</ix:nonFraction>, respectively due to companies controlled by Braeden Lichti, of which $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c270" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:UnsecuredDebt" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-12697">861,254</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c271" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:UnsecuredDebt" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-12698">642,925</ix:nonFraction> respectively is unsecured, non-interest
bearing and are due on demand.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify">As of June 30, 2026, the Company had $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c263" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LegalFees" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-12699">849,630</ix:nonFraction> (December 31, 2025 -
