<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Company&#8217;s continuing operations consist of <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:NumberOfReportableSegments" scale="0" unitRef="segments" id="ixv-12717">three</ix:nonFraction> reportable segments: (i) corporate, treasury and biosciences (ii) IT packaging
solutions (iii) precision engineering and machining. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" name="us-gaap:SegmentReportingCodmProfitLossMeasureHowUsedDescription" id="ixv-8895">The <span style="-sec-ix-hidden: hidden-fact-316">Chief Executive Officer</span> has been identified as the Chief Operating Decision
Maker (CODM).</ix:nonNumeric></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

